sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Op as feast-operator<br/>redhat-ods-applications
    participant SCA as OpenShift service CA
    participant WB as Workbench<br/>label feast-integration=true
    participant Online as Online server<br/>443→6567/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reg as Registry<br/>443→6571/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant Store as Online / offline store<br/>configured port
    participant Cron as CronJob pod<br/>ose-cli
    participant Dash as rhods-dashboard
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>443→8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DRReg as Feast REST registry<br/>127.0.0.1:6572 HTTP
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant UI as Feast UI<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over User,SCA: Flow 1: FeatureStore reconciliation
    User->>K8s: Create FeatureStore CR<br/>TLS 1.2+, user token (featurestore-editor)
    Op->>K8s: Watch FeatureStore, read referenced Secrets<br/>TLS 1.2+, SA token
    Op->>K8s: Create Deployment, Services, Route, PVC,<br/>NetworkPolicies, RBAC, CronJob
    SCA-->>K8s: Issue feast-{name}-{type}-tls Secrets
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note over WB,Store: Flow 2: Online feature retrieval from a workbench
    WB->>Online: POST /get-online-features<br/>TLS (service CA), Bearer token
    Online->>K8s: TokenReview<br/>TLS 1.2+, Feast pod SA
    K8s-->>Online: Authenticated identity
    Online->>Reg: Registry lookup (gRPC)<br/>TLS, intra-communication token
    Reg-->>Online: Feature definitions
    Online->>Store: Read features<br/>Configurable TLS, DB credentials
    Store-->>Online: Feature values
    Online-->>WB: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 225)
    Note over Cron,Store: Flow 3: Scheduled materialization
    Cron->>K8s: pods/exec on feast Deployment<br/>HTTPS/WSS TLS 1.2+, CronJob SA (per-CR Role)
    K8s->>Online: exec feast materialize-incremental
    Online->>Store: Offline → online store copy<br/>Store credentials
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
    Note over Dash,DRReg: Flow 4: Dashboard / data-registry access
    Dash->>KRP: GET /v1/{project}/namespaces/...<br/>TLS (service CA), user Bearer token
    KRP->>K8s: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>dataregistry.opendatahub.io, auth-delegator SA
    K8s-->>KRP: Allowed
    KRP->>DRReg: Forward over loopback (no TLS)<br/>X-Remote-User header
    DRReg-->>KRP: Catalog data
    KRP-->>Dash: Response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 230, 255)
    Note over Browser,UI: Flow 5: UI access
    Browser->>Router: HTTPS 443, no auth at Route
    Router->>UI: Reencrypt TLS (service CA)<br/>No auth detected in UI server
    UI-->>Browser: Feast UI
    end
